      "intro": {
        "title": "We're here to support great teaching",
        "bodyPortableText": [
          {
            "_key": "ced9ea6b63ff",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "7c4b1c2261660",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Whether you’re creating new lessons, refreshing your approach, or solving a last-minute challenge, our resources give you a strong foundation that means you get there faster."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ],
        "mediaType": "video",
        "alignMedia": "left",
        "cta": null,
        "image": null,
        "video": {
          "title": "Who we are V2",
          "transcript": [
            {
              "_key": "f242609a-645a-4d5f-b66e-6d04dd21cc8e",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "d75788ee-b1b2-4dbd-930f-8f7b4dbfc8d4",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "﻿Our mission here at Oak National Academy is to support great teaching. We do that through two goals."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "346cbcf7f048",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "407a0438ca7d",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "First is we are aiming to lower teacher workload, and we're trying to do that by providing really high-quality starting points for your lesson planning through our teaching resources, slide decks, quizzes, and worksheets."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "0f76a18a48cc",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "53934cd76555",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Second, we're helping improve pupil outcomes by providing access to really high-quality curricula."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "83f1ef97159a",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "b44d4cbdd537",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "There are two unique things about Oak National Academy. First, and it's a first, we're creating curricula for key stages 1 to 4 across all of national curriculum subjects, and that includes thousands of slides, worksheets, and quizzes, to use as a high-quality starting point in your lesson planning."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "_key": "554dc5b08636",
              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "6e5c6a2adabf",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "And second, we are creating a video library of teachers teaching all of that content, which is a really powerful resource for ECTs, non-specialists, and to use in cover, or even to analyse in professional development sessions."
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": [],
              "style": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "video": {
            "asset": {
              "assetId": "KHUK004YVrDuBlZH1YK01J2KQw2AyxGwpy00l016qIO3jDU",
              "thumbTime": null,
              "playbackId": "CjDAe0153o6v65Te4npM9165RqrAJd6YrSeOufA02RKLE"
            }
          }
        }
